{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ec8e1eaf-12f8-86af-9ca5-0834199fd66e",
  "created_at": "2026-02-26T14:09:10-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carmela Iannuccilli",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T14:07:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T14:07:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. I need to report road damage. The edge of the pavement is crumbling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T14:07:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. Whereabouts is this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T14:07:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "118 Farewell Street. In the North End. It's right at the curve."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T14:07:34-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "118 Farewell, at the curve. Got it. And when you say crumbling, is it a hole in the road, or more the edge breaking off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T14:07:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The edge. Chunks coming off along the side where the road curves. One section is about two feet across."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T14:07:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two feet across. Okay, I'm writing that down. Is it out in the travel lane or just along the shoulder?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T14:08:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly the edge. Cars clip it on the turn, though. Sorry, one second. I'm peeling an orange."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T14:08:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, no problem. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T14:08:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. The smell is strong. Real sharp, citrusy. Anyway. It's getting bigger."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T14:08:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can smell it from here, almost. So, edge breaking off at the curve, about two feet, getting bigger. Anything else, like water pooling there or anything sticking up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T14:08:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No water. Just loose gravel and broken asphalt. I'd like the street added to the repair list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T14:08:33-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, I'll put it in as a request for Farewell Street. I can't give you a date on when a crew gets out there, but it'll be logged with the location and the size."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T14:08:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I own the building, so I just want it on record."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T14:08:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Do you want a callback number on the request?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T14:08:56-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. 401-555-0197."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T14:08:58-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Five-five-five, oh-one-nine-seven. Perfect. Name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T14:09:00-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Carmela Iannuccilli. I-A-N-N-U-C-C-I-L-L-I."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T14:09:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Carmela. You're all set. It's in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T14:09:06-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T14:09:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take care."
    }
  ],
